    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When a refinement fire still threatens young Thieving Heaven, Fang Yuan activates chimney smoke Gu so smoke covers the basin sized fire and weakens the connection enough that the smoke could extinguish the fire and stop the refinement. After the fire absorbs that smoke and a baby phantom attacks, he throws chimney smoke Gu itself as bait. The phantom eats it, which buys him distance before he continues the improvised material sequence that yields sneak attack Gu.",
