    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Sha Xiao’s transferred information includes the mortal killer move Blurred Grey Eyes, formed from sandpit Gu, chimney smoke Gu, and clear water Gu. It has eight steps. Successful activation puffs out white smoke that covers a target’s eyes in white ash and blinds them; washing with water makes the ash produce high heat that can burn the eyes and cause lasting blindness. Fang Yuan activates Blurred Grey Eyes in the clan competition and defeats his opponent with the ash and a kick.",
