  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When Fang Yuan regains control of young Thieving Heaven against desert wolves, the aperture holds only a sandpit Gu, a chimney smoke Gu, and a clear water Gu. At a critical moment he puts all his remaining primeval essence into chimney smoke Gu. Dense smoke obstructs the wolves’ eyes and noses long enough for him to pull ahead, though the Gu was originally used to smoke food.",
